{"seq":2,"slug":"relational-databases","title":"关系型数据库","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"managed-rds-comparison","title":"托管关系型数据库服务对比","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases/managed-rds-comparison","wordCount":1411,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"aurora-spanner-cockroach","title":"Aurora、Spanner 与 CockroachDB 架构对比","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases/aurora-spanner-cockroach","wordCount":1414,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"read-replica-sharding","title":"读副本与分片策略","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases/read-replica-sharding","wordCount":1776,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 关系型数据库\n\n关系型数据库仍然是 2026 年云工作负载的基石——超过 70% 的 OLTP 应用运行在某种形式的 SQL 引擎上。本章将三个核心选型维度拆开：首先对比主流托管 RDS 服务的功能与定价；然后深入 Aurora DSQL、Spanner、CockroachDB 三款分布式关系型产品的架构取舍；最后讨论读副本与分片策略如何在不更换引擎的前提下解决扩展瓶颈。\n"}